              "text": "ಪುರಭವನ — purabhavana — \"a town hall\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪುರಭವನದ ಮುಂದೆ ಒಂದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಗಡಿಯಾರ ಇದೆ. purabhavanada munde ondu doḍḍa gaḍiyāra ide. There is a big clock in front of the town hall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪುರ, a town, plus ಭವನ, a building or mansion."
            }
          ]
        },
