          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪುರಭವನ (purabhavana) is a modern compound built from Sanskrit words: pura, \"a fortress, a town\" (CDIAL 8278), and bhavana, \"a place of abode\" (CDIAL 9417)."
            }
          ]
        },
